{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022353_721f7e87","chunk_index":15,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_592627c65fa92131","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3a882d12f1c39d5","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1bab119d767e0f49","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_e093ad5004cde0c6"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022353_721f7e87","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"妊娠事件的报告与随访","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"依据已确认的妊娠或哺乳期排除标准及研究时期、安全性随访安排，本节覆盖妊娠事件报告与随访的目的和范围，未写入报告时限、报告对象、报告文件、事件分类或避孕要求等未确认内容。医学作者需核对本项目妊娠事件的报告路径与时限、报告对象与报告文件、妊娠结局随访的终止时点，以及与不良事件、严重不良事件分类的衔接规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（妊娠事件的报告与随访），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_592627c65fa92131","section_number":"8.8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022353_721f7e87","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","quote":"章节编号=9\n章节标题=统计分析","quote_sha256":"ad86233544f5ecca4636ca77ad3f15463d6a372bb0aa3f140edef4fae0d42492","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","span_id":"span_sel_9"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_key_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_other_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_stats"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"双侧α=0.05、把握度90%","quote_sha256":"a5b5bab98a17fc1a82b417739b5cacbf027ccd06b440142c27e12add1fc48376","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_alpha"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f4332a7188562f2625d53aa7f770cea155664564c5fb821a98efd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_ssr"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_9","span_proj_primary","span_proj_key_secondary","span_proj_other_secondary","span_proj_estimand","span_proj_stats","span_proj_alpha","span_proj_ssr"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用优效性设计，统计分析以评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂的疗效为主要目标。全分析集包括所有随机受试者，按随机分组进行分析，用于主要疗效评价；安全性集按受试者实际接受的治疗进行分析。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例，主要分析采用CMH方法比较试验组与安慰剂组的应答率，报告组间应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，检验水准为双侧α=0.05。缺失数据处理采用治疗策略框架：停药或使用救援治疗的受试者按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析。关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例，以及第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例；其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。本研究不计划开展期中分析，也不计划进行样本量再估计。","rationale":"依据已确认的估计目标策略与统计分析策略，本节纳入全分析集与安全性集、CMH检验、组间应答率差及95%置信区间、双侧α=0.05、无应答填补、多重插补与观察病例敏感性分析、不开展期中分析及样本量再估计。医学作者需与统计职能核对关键次要终点的检验顺序与多重性控制策略，以及连续型次要终点的统计分析方法。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（统计分析），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3a882d12f1c39d5","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022353_721f7e87","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","quote":"章节编号=9.5\n章节标题=安全性数据分析","quote_sha256":"842a9e87c54701f663e0c17fb89e5e71b34eba55dd0b12fa5695d611bee66a4d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","span_id":"span_sel_9_5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_stats"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_visits"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_9_5","span_proj_safety_endpoints","span_proj_stats","span_proj_periods","span_proj_visits"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"安全性数据分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"安全性分析基于安全性集开展，按受试者实际接受的治疗进行分组，分析范围覆盖双盲治疗期和安全性随访期收集的安全性数据。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。分析时按治疗组对不良事件相关终点汇总例数与发生率，呈现其总体发生情况；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图结果结合基线值进行评价，重点关注具有临床意义的变化。安全性分析结果与疗效分析结果共同支持研究药物的获益-风险评价。","rationale":"依据已确认的安全性终点、安全性集按实际治疗分析的要求以及双盲治疗期与安全性随访期安排，本节描述安全性终点的组成与按治疗组的通用汇总方式。医学作者需核对不良事件编码与分类字典、严重程度分级、因果关系判定、实验室检查与12导联心电图异常的判定标准及安全性数据的具体汇总维度。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1bab119d767e0f49","section_number":"9.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022353_721f7e87","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","quote":"章节编号=10\n章节标题=数据采集与管理","quote_sha256":"8d852c5c1a331f1fcfd19cfe9974334fe2f4aa2dc92fd6a1c5a3fb5c891f010d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","span_id":"span_sel_10"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_adherence"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_other_secondary"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_10","span_proj_periods","span_proj_visits","span_proj_adherence","span_proj_other_secondary"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"数据采集与管理","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"研究数据的采集与管理覆盖筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期所产生的全部数据。访视安排为：筛选后于基线/第1天完成随机化，双盲治疗期在第2、4、8、12、16周进行访视，第20周进行安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价，DLQI评估结果作为疗效相关数据一并收集。安全性数据包括不良事件信息、实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图结果；治疗依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。各类评估结果的记录方式、数据录入与核查、数据质疑的处理、数据管理职责、数据锁定以及研究文档与记录的保存要求，均属于数据采集与管理的范围。全部研究数据应真实、准确、完整、可追溯，并符合适用的法规要求。","rationale":"依据已确认的访视策略、PASI和sPGA评价时点、DLQI终点信息及依从性评价方法，本节描述数据采集与管理的目的和范围。医学作者需与数据管理职能核对数据采集系统与录入方式、核查与质疑处理流程、数据锁定安排、数据管理职责分工及研究文档保存要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_e093ad5004cde0c6","section_number":"10","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:c28fd3c28cf8c6bd70eaa0ef","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"e1861c1cf06a9cedf1ffd780e8cdb5aa72f21bb16533754d3900ee2997f2a66c"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:779|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"15c0e0648fb1262269fbc08e6dc67ec9615feeae6b6fd1d8cce97600976fd30f"},{"locator":"section:6.3.4 妊娠|block:1004|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"cb010b851f23cc35b2475172482dcafaa036b5ccf3fff41bdf7856b256c21d01"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:1005|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9fb0a4912da17b734c482911e3f8676a02e40742fe9755f9bc660005ec3f235b"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的随访|block:831|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"e9a73951b4b81029575c055f51e285b89ca3c683bf8d59bb10d324446e599f88"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:780|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b9b87b6fdc7e1f66998ba71f26c620e9ef58283aa6a13ea02f7d4f9d3fff3781"}]}